This version
------------

    E-Pad Reset
    https://github.com/DSGM-GMSD/e-padreset

    Modified by DSGM-GMSD (PadReset), September and October 2026.

    Relicensed to GPL-3.0, which the GPL-2.0-or-later terms of the original
    permit. The move to GPL-3.0 is what makes the maintenance-box data
    combinable at all: section 13 of GPL-3.0 allows a covered work to be
    combined with one licensed under AGPL-3.0.

    Substantially modified: the user interface, the service layer, the model
    catalog and the write path have been rewritten or replaced. What remains
    substantially the original is the protocol and USB transport layer —
    EpsonProtocol, Escp2MaintenanceProtocol and UsbTransport — which is where
    the reverse-engineering work of the upstream projects lives.

    The full licence text is in LICENSE.


Data and assets derived from other projects
-------------------------------------------

    app/src/main/assets/devices.xml
        Copied from CiRIP/ez-reset. Its own licensing is not stated by its
        author, which the README records as an open question rather than a
        settled one.

    app/src/main/assets/maintenance_boxes.xml
    app/src/main/assets/reinkpy_models.xml
        Generated from the model database of atufi/reinkpy, AGPL-3.0, read
        through the parsed mirror published by yusnel-rojas/epson-reset.
        Generated by scripts/sync-model-data.mjs, which credits the source in
        each file's header.

    app/src/main/res/font/
        Space Grotesk and Figtree, from the Google Fonts repository, under the
        SIL Open Font License. The licence texts are bundled in
        app/src/main/res/raw/ofl_space_grotesk.txt and ofl_figtree.txt.


